]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_L3Decision","status":"resolved","id":"e6935daced0fa530","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_L3Decision|L3Decision]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_L3CertificateCorrect","status":"resolved","id":"e468bfa09e147505","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_L3CertificateCorrect|L3CertificateCorrect]]","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":2148,"backlinks":[{"id":"2a802213915eee42","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[11_三值语义]]"},{"id":"821cc7c74f0b09ef","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"各参数的意义、构造子及局部条款见 [[000_ZFC/11_三值语义]]。纯语言约定见 [[000_ZFC/01_language]]，有限证明列的读法见 [[000_ZFC/02_proofs]]。"}],"outgoing":["2599832c1bfb4f3c","45346a8e861cbc4a","e0d30adc92d51179","c692e22ab51d5335","9104a0b6c6ec0569","e56e1132597c40e3","b475d7d49a565a3e","6c6245d4da289ece","8dfa83196961379b","a432614896241213","399e79d7cc96c3d4","e6935daced0fa530","e468bfa09e147505"]}